# Corpora, crash artifacts and build output: all reproducible, none of it source.
# A crash worth keeping becomes a unit test in the crate it belongs to, which is
# where it will actually be run — see
# `an_absurd_clock_does_not_panic_any_animated_widget` in denise-ui.
target/
corpus/
artifacts/
coverage/

# Captured by the CI job, uploaded only when something breaks.
*.log
